  "transcript_source": "captions",
  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 3.97,
      "e": 5.79,
      "text": "- It was like something snapped in my mind."
    },
    {
      "s": 5.79,
      "e": 7.45,
      "text": "And the training was there."
    },
    {
      "s": 7.45,
      "e": 9.39,
      "text": "I knew what to do, how to do it."
    },
    {
      "s": 9.39,
      "e": 11.3,
      "text": "Just kicked in and I didn't think about it."
    },
    {
      "s": 11.3,
      "e": 13.87,
      "text": "It was kind of like second hand nature."
    },
    {
      "s": 13.87,
      "e": 16.6,
      "text": "So I was at a party, I noticed a little girl"
    },
    {
      "s": 16.6,
      "e": 17.43,
      "text": "and she looked kind of like"
    },
    {
      "s": 17.43,
      "e": 19.17,
      "text": "lifeless at the bottom of a pool."
    },
    {
      "s": 19.17,
      "e": 21.41,
      "text": "So I kind of just jumped in, brought her up."
    },
    {
      "s": 21.41,
      "e": 23.41,
      "text": "We got her out of the side of the pool."
    },
    {
      "s": 23.41,
      "e": 26.31,
      "text": "It was for about five, ten minutes we were doing CPR."
    },
    {
      "s": 26.31,
      "e": 30.05,
      "text": "They were all, you know, right behind me, on my shoulders,"
    },
    {
      "s": 30.05,
      "e": 31.92,
      "text": "please bring her back, please bring her back."
    },
    {
      "s": 31.92,
      "e": 33.88,
      "text": "From there, they got her in the back of an ambulance."
    },
    {
      "s": 33.88,
      "e": 36.47,
      "text": "They had to sedate her and breathe for her."
    },
    {
      "s": 36.47,
      "e": 38.41,
      "text": "I'm a medical technician."
    },
    {
      "s": 38.41,
      "e": 39.89,
      "text": "We can be sent anywhere."
    },
    {
      "s": 39.89,
      "e": 41.22,
      "text": "You hope that you never have to"
    },
    {
      "s": 41.22,
      "e": 44.13,
      "text": "use that training, but you never know."
    },
    {
      "s": 45.14,
      "e": 49.09,
      "text": "Pretty like confident in my skills as a medic now."
    },
    {
      "s": 49.09,
      "e": 52.23,
      "text": "Like I know if I need them they're there."
    },
    {
      "s": 52.23,
      "e": 56.93,
      "text": "Maybe happy to know that I was a part of bringing her back."
    }
  ],
